# Dissemination coverage + Compose harness (S019 / EV-014)

Traces to ADR-007, ADR-030, E14-04, E14-09, execution-plan T0.1 / T3.3.
Amended by EV-080 / #1077 (universal **100%** floor).

## Coverage (`packages/dissemination`)

- Enforce **100%** line+branch coverage via `packages/dissemination/pyproject.toml`
  `[tool.coverage.report] fail_under = 100` (sibling bar: all packages under ADR-007).
- Local / CI entrypoint: `make test-unit-dissemination` →
  `scripts/ci/run_dissemination_coverage.sh`.
- **EV-080 sequencing:** if the script/pyproject still say `95`, flip to `100` only in
  Build T2.4 after fills (fill-before-flip) — never lower the floor.
- Script **skips (exit 0)** until T1.1/T1.2 create `packages/dissemination/pyproject.toml`
  (historical note; package now exists).
- Do **not** lower the global ADR-007 **100%** floor.

## wis2box Compose harness (F17)

- Overlay file: `docker-compose.wis2box.yml` (profile `wis2box`) — service `wis2box`.
- Image: `packages/dissemination/docker/wis2box-harness` (MQTT + HTTP dataset
  stand-in; **not** the full WMO wis2box stack; **not** a Render web service — E14-04=B).
- CI/Makefile: `make compose-wis2box-up` / `scripts/ci/run_wis2box_harness.sh`
  (integration job in `ci-cd.yml`).
- Staging allowlist must list Compose/CI hosts when the harness runs
  (`DISSEMINATION_EGRESS_ALLOWLIST=wis2box,127.0.0.1,127.0.0.0/8,localhost` — ADR-029;
  matches `.env.example` + `scripts/ci/run_wis2box_harness.sh`).

## Package boundary

- No FastAPI / Supabase imports in `packages/dissemination` (ADR-030).
- Thin routers live under `apps/backend` only.
